sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Device
    participant A as Auth Service
    participant K as Key Service
    participant M as MQTT Broker
    participant C as Certificate Authority
    
    Note over D,M: Initial Device Registration
    D->>D: Generate ECDSA Key Pair
    D->>C: Request Device Certificate
    C->>D: Issue X.509 Certificate
    
    Note over D,M: Authentication Flow
    D->>A: 1. Request Auth Challenge
    Note right of A: Generate nonce & challenge
    A->>D: 2. Challenge + Nonce
    
    D->>D: 3. Sign Challenge with Device Private Key
    Note right of D: signature = ECDSA_Sign(challenge, deviceKey)
    
    D->>A: 4. Submit (deviceId, challenge, signature, nonce)
    
    A->>A: 5. Verify Signature
    Note right of A: Verify ECDSA signature<br/>Check nonce validity<br/>Validate device certificate
    
    alt Signature Valid
        A->>K: 6. Request JWT Generation
        Note right of K: Create JWT with:<br/>- Device ID<br/>- Groups<br/>- Permissions<br/>- Expiry (15min)
        K->>A: 7. JWT + Refresh Token
        A->>D: 8. Return Tokens + MQTT Config
        
        D->>M: 9. Connect with JWT
        Note right of D: MQTT over TLS 1.3<br/>Username: deviceId<br/>Password: JWT
        
        M->>A: 10. Validate JWT
        Note right of M: Verify JWT signature<br/>Check expiry<br/>Validate permissions
        
        A->>M: 11. Validation Result
        M->>D: 12. Connection Established
        
        Note over D,M: Periodic Token Refresh
        loop Every 10 minutes
            D->>A: Refresh Token
            A->>D: New JWT
            D->>M: Update Authentication
        end
        
    else Signature Invalid
        A->>D: Authentication Failed
        Note right of D: Exponential backoff<br/>before retry
    end